        "text_CfcJd4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Federal Compliance: The Gold Standard in GVM Upgrades</strong>Experience total peace of mind on Australian roads with a fully federally approved GVM upgrade. Eliminate the risk of defects and navigate state borders without bureaucratic friction.</p><p><strong>Federally Certified Engineering:</strong> Operating under <strong>Offroad Industries (ORI)</strong> Vehicle Type Approvals (<strong>VTA-065187</strong> & <strong>VTA-065796</strong>), we provide a seamless pathway to upgrade your vehicle from <strong>NB1 to NB2</strong>, or facilitate an NB2-to-NB2 enhancement.<br/></p><p><strong>Second Stage of Manufacture (SSM):</strong> By installing this upgrade prior to first registration, your vehicle is legally manufactured to a higher Gross Vehicle Mass specification before it ever wears number plates.<br/></p><p><strong>True National Recognition:</strong> Unlike state-based modifications, this federal approval is recognised instantly across all Australian states and territories—negating the need for re-engineering if you travel or relocate interstate.<br/></p><p><strong>Protect Your Investment:</strong> As a federally codified change listed on your vehicle’s compliance plate, this upgrade protects your vehicle’s resale value far better than standard aftermarket modifications.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
